# Harness rules

1. Read `<project>/.harness/project.manifest.json` and `project-context.md` first.
2. Generic runtime docs: `$AGENT_HARNESS_HOME/docs/kit/`.
3. Do not mix product specs into harness root changes.
4. Run verification commands from the project manifest.
